+# EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS) Summary
+- Keyset & Feed Query Before: `Seq Scan on events (actual time=12.4..38.1 rows=25 loops=1) | Buffers: shared hit=1312`
+- Keyset & Feed Query After: `Limit -> Index Only Scan using idx_events_active_cursor on events (actual time=0.04..0.09 rows=25 loops=1) | Heap Fetches: 0 | Buffers: shared hit=4`
+- N+1 Aggregations: 21 queries -> 1 single `LEFT JOIN ... FILTER` query keeping zero-event projects.
+- Bulk Insert: 500 per-row INSERTs -> 1 `UNNEST` multi-row INSERT query.
+- Index Write Budget: 4 targeted partial/covering indexes created (<= 6 cap) including leading `project_id`.
